  "question": {
    "text": "Given below are two statements :<br />Statement I : The process of producing syn-gas is called gasification of coal.<br />Statement II : The composition of syn-gas is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br />In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "E86mq",
      "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false.",
